!}

[? if radical_split = 0 : The <span style="color: #7A1F5C;">**Radicals**</span> mobilize, confident that the law secures their ability to enforce Reconstruction without presidential interference. ?]

[? if radical_split = 1 : The breakaway <span style="color: #7A1F5C;">**Radical Republican Party**</span> mobilizes its own supporters in celebration, confident that the law secures the ability to enforce Reconstruction without presidential interference, regardless of which organization gets the credit. ?]

@caution
